-- smucclaw/l4-ide#1102: closed constants read from an imported module.
-- `l4 export dmn` writes one file and no DMN import, so before #1102 each
-- reference below was a FEEL name with nothing behind it: KIE refused the
-- whole file (Unknown variable) and Camunda answered null.
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `export-imported-limits`

-- in a guard, through a chain of two more imported constants
GIVEN hours IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `band` hours IS
  IF hours GREATER THAN `the longest week` THEN "over"
  ELSE IF hours EQUALS `the longest week` THEN "at"
       ELSE "under"

-- inside a business knowledge model: `scaled` is called with two different
-- arguments, so it is emitted as a BKM, and the constant is passed in
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `scaled` y IS y TIMES `the threshold`

GIVEN x IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `doubled limit` x IS `scaled` (x TIMES 2) PLUS `scaled` 1

-- under a list quantifier
GIVEN items IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `all within` items IS all (GIVEN n YIELD n AT MOST `the threshold`) items
